      "created_at": "2013-09-08T21:08:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Is irreducible damage considered a \"type\" of damage? &nbsp;Forgive me for not remembering all the card names, but I know that Legacy has a card that allows him to become immue to a choosen type of damage and Visionary has a card that allows her to change the type of damage to that of her choice. &nbsp;Is irreducible damage a valid type to choose for these (and other similar) cards? &nbsp;Or is irreducible a modifier, like +1 or -1, rather than a type?</p>",
